test_purpose:
(1)

with { UE in NR RRC_IDLE state }
ensure that {

   when { UE finds a suitable cell that provides access by NR NTN RAT and cellBarredNTN in SIB1 is
not present }

       then { the UE considers the cell as barred and no camping on this cell can take place }
                     }

(2)

with { UE in NR RRC_IDLE state }                                         and cellBarredNTN in SIB1 is
ensure that {

   when { UE finds a suitable cell that provides access by NR NTN RAT
"not barred" }

       then { the UE considers the cell suitable and camps on it }
                     }

(3)

with { UE in NR RRC_IDLE state }
ensure that {

   when { UE finds a suitable cell that provides access by NR NTN RAT and cellBarredNTN in SIB1
changes to "barred" }

       then { the UE considers the cell as barred and no camping on this cell can take place }
                       }
